  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 35192588719496683
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2757966820b1c56408bfbbd8d30dd10f, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: That already changes the way the place feels.
    - rid: 1121235660944851240
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: It is only one more small repair.
    - rid: 1649893629176358916
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2757966820b1c56408bfbbd8d30dd10f, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Small repairs are how you prove something is not beyond saving.
    - rid: 1586568789148481548
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: When did you become philosophical?
    - rid: 6262238917093620645
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2757966820b1c56408bfbbd8d30dd10f, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: About five minutes before you started serving free samples.
    - rid: 909640216147464231
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: They were not free. You said you would pay later.
    - rid: 309156393946171218
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2757966820b1c56408bfbbd8d30dd10f, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: And I intend to remain consistent.
    - rid: 736682355874275152
      type: {class: ThoughtStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Maybe doing this alone was never part of the plan.
